(3) THE ARCHIMEDEAN RESIDUAL: surviving free intervals in cell a=1 & the 98-RESONANCE
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------

   j=6 / 14 (=14*1):  m_1 = 7/1716 = 0.00407925
      2 surviving free interval(s) in cell a=1:
        (0.159341, 0.160714) width 0.0013736   bounded by ['L:runner13(k=2)', 'R:runner12(k=2)']
        (0.172619, 0.175325) width 0.0027056   bounded by ['L:runner12(k=2)', 'R:runner11(k=2)']

   j=6 / 98 (=2*7^2 RESONANT):  m_1 = 1543/588588 = 0.00262153
      3 surviving free interval(s) in cell a=1:
        (0.159341, 0.160714) width 0.0013736   bounded by ['L:runner13(k=2)', 'R:runner12(k=2)']
        (0.172619, 0.172741) width 0.0001215   bounded by ['L:runner12(k=2)', 'R:runner98(k=17)']
        (0.174198, 0.175325) width 0.0011264   bounded by ['L:runner98(k=17)', 'R:runner11(k=2)']

   RESONANCE: replacing 14 by 98 SHAVES cell a=1 from 0.0040793 to 0.0026215
   delta m_1 = -1/686 = -0.00145773  (and the same in a=6, doubling)
   Mechanism: 98 ≡ 0 mod 7 AND mod 49 -> its danger band (half-width 1/1372) lands at
   k/98 = 17/98 = 0.173469 RIGHT INSIDE a wide gap of the 14-core, splitting it.
   So the resonance is a THIN-BAND SPLIT of an existing gap, not a wholesale cell kill.

----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
(4) DOES L FACTOR as (7-local cell count)/7 x (archimedean within-cell density)?
----------------------------------------------------------------------------------
   Candidate factorization  L = (N_surv / 7) * Rbar  where N_surv = # surviving cells,
   Rbar = mean over surviving cells of the conditional density R_a = 7 * m_a.

   j=6 / 98 (=2*7^2 RESONANT):  N_surv=2, R_a over surviving cells = [0.018350696922125494, 0.018350696922125494]
      Rbar=0.0183507; (N_surv/7)*Rbar = 0.00524306 vs actual L=0.00524306
      => factorization is EXACT iff all R_a equal. spread max/min R_a = 1.0000 (CLEAN PRODUCT (a=1,a=6 mirror-equal))

   j=6 / 14 (=14*1):  N_surv=2, R_a over surviving cells = [0.028554778554778556, 0.028554778554778556]
      Rbar=0.0285548; (N_surv/7)*Rbar = 0.00815851 vs actual L=0.00815851
      => factorization is EXACT iff all R_a equal. spread max/min R_a = 1.0000 (CLEAN PRODUCT (a=1,a=6 mirror-equal))

   ==> PARTIAL FACTORIZATION CONFIRMED:
       7-LOCAL factor = N_surv/7 = 2/7 (which cells; pure residue-mod-7 combinatorics).
       ARCHIMEDEAN factor = R_a (within-cell gap density; equal across the 2 surviving
       cells by the tau<->1-tau mirror).  So L = (2/7)*R, R = 7*m_1 EXACTLY.

